From 95ab919be84778351d9c2607a17bf9eb4ac40a48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rob Bloodgood <rob@exitexchange.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 09:58:53 -0700
Subject: [portal-cosmic PATCH 1/2] feat: InputCapture portal and Clipboard via
 ext-data-control

Wire org.freedesktop.impl.portal.InputCapture to cosmic-comp, and add a
Clipboard backend (KDE-shaped ext-data-control client) so Deskflow can
sync the Ctrl+C/V clipboard across machines on COSMIC Wayland.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
